  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ej juon project ekōmmane aolepān kōn AI.<\/0> Line otemjej an code an Orion-81 make rar jeje kōn Claude Code, rōkōjeraļok ej ṃōttan. Baat otemjej, mep, texture im ainikien rar kōmmane kōn kein ko Claude Code ear jeje. Rōkōjeraļok ej kōnnaan ta eo en kōmmane; Claude Code ej bukwōn ewi. Library ko rej open-source rej bed ioon rej pād ilo lalem ilo 'Jab AI ear kōmmane'. Juon men ej bar ṃōttan im kwaļo̧k: juon <1>lale lainsen<\/1> kōn code in gēm eo ear itok jān prototype in GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion ear jino ilo 28 September 2026 āinwōt juon prototype ioon engine in open-source Quake III Arena (GPL), im baat ko jān Elite Dangerous rar kōjerbal āinwōt kōjeraļok. Ilo raan eo kein ruo, code in gēm eo ear wanļo̧k ñan BuB, juon engine ekāāl ear jeje kōn Claude Code; module ko an gēm eo rar itok jān prototype im rar kōmmane etan ko ekāāl. Release 0.3.0 ear leļo̧k ñan 16 kain baat otemjej hull ko ekāāl aer make. Juon lale lainsen ej kajjitōk bwe ewōr code ko rej bar itok jān GPL eo ṃokta, im bwe baat ko ṃokta rar ekkar tata ñan kōjeraļok. Juon scan otomatik in ekkar jān code eo ñan source an prototype in GPL ear wanlo̧k ilo 8 October 2026, im lale an rekspet kōn ekkar ko ej ṃōttan. Men otemjej rej itok jān ṃokta naaj jeje bar ak kōmmane bar.",
