  "d.21ryis": "Kakkije ko in ATTACK rej wanlo̧k ilo juon enimi im eo ej pāleļe.",
  "d.2pbr86": "Ṃedeen",
  "d.2r8k8j": "AIR EJ KŌTTAR",
  "d.2sqinp": "Jilu baat kōn plume in engine ioon Glasgow ej kōrkōr, baat an pilot ej buñ ilo ṃokta.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Juon scan otomatik in ekkar jān code in gēm eo ñan source an prototype in GPL ear wanlo̧k ilo {date0}. Lale an rekspet kōn ekkar ko ej ṃōttan. Men otemjej rej lo bwe rar kopi ak kōmmane bar naaj jeje bar.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Plume ko in engine ear kōmmane jān nozzle, juon ANVIL 240 m kōn hangar emaroñ lo ilo im kapen ko, NEEDLE ko rej kōtļo̧k jān pein ko ruo, ATTACK in juon ak eo ej pāleļe, im ANVIL ko an AI rej kōtļo̧k wing ko aer.",
  "d.3b0pca": "EKSPLŌRA",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Round eo ṃokta in bōk mōnā jān armej otemjej.",
  "d.3ednu": "Kōmmane bar otemjej jān engine AI-BuB ñan Unreal Engine 5",
  "d.3m3q6c": "Ṃōņ jān ran, im flare ko kajjojo jet minit.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Joñoul jiljino kilomita in jikin ṃwiin ioon Clyde ilo lan eṃōn kaļ. Kajoor in lal mollo̧k, air mollo̧k, ioon ṃwiin ko im crane ko: kōtļo̧k mōkaj eo am im jab kōtļo̧k mejān am ioon river eo.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, pija in sector jān menu an gēm. Pija jān gēm, vershon 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "kain baat ko",
  "d.4pqks5": "Code in gēm eo ej wanļo̧k ñan BuB, juon engine ekāāl ear jeje kōn Claude Code. Module ko an gēm eo rej itok jān prototype im rej kōmmane etan ko ekāāl bwe ilju.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "Juon screen LOADOUT mokta jān match otemjej (juon armej im lobby in multiplayer) kōn tier ko an hull im jiļ, kaloor in jiļ, line ko ñan jikin kajeje otemjej im baat ko in bay an ANVIL.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "LĒJA KO",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Bwilok: ejjeļo̧k drag.",
  "d.61r5q7": "JIKIN HANGAR KŌN 10 NEEDLE",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Kuļap ko in tōrōt lēja im jibwe rej jino ilo AUTO.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Vershon 0 (demo) ear kōttar: 8 kain baat, lēja ko im tarinae in salvo, THETA-7 asteroid field.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Disk in Ran, juon pija ñan jikin lale mep ko.",
  "d.709qra": "Kajoor ñan kōņaan, lōļ ñan jibwe. Ñe kwoj lōļ ilo 50 % in kōņaan ak elōñ, ej jibwe; ñe ekadu jān eo, ej kōtļo̧k.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Jikin jijet in jikin kajeje, volley ko in rokit jiljino kōn camera ej tōl, boost ruo alen, lēja ko in ripple an ANVIL, juon bay an ANVIL ej kōtļo̧k 10 NEEDLE ro rej ippān, im juon slider in camera-shake.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Men otemjej rej kōmmane kōn AI ioon engine BuB, kōn Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Multiplayer ilo network ijin (lo gēm ko ioon Wi-Fi eo juon, host ak iten juon lobby, kōtļo̧k ippān; wave ko in co-op im tarinae ippān otemjej) im jilu mep ekāāl: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT im SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER āinwōt ej kwaļo̧k ilo menu an hangar an gēm, hull in vershon 0.6.1, lale jilu-ian-emān ioon ṃweiļ.",
