  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Kōnke jibwe ko an ej kōnnaan in kōpooļ ro. Gēm eo ej jino AI ear kōmmane aolepān bwe en maroñ wōr, innām rōkōmmane rej wōnān rej jolok jerbal an AI, kōn etan.",
