  "faq.notYetLan": "Jab ñan kiō. Multiplayer ioon LAN ilo network eo juon ej jerbal gai (jān 0.2.0); kōjerbal ioon online ejjab kōmmane.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype eo ear kōmmane ioon engine in open-source Quake III Arena (GPL) im ear bōk baat ko jān Elite Dangerous āinwōt kōjeraļok. Ilo raan eo kein ruo, code in gēm eo ear wanļo̧k ñan BuB, juon engine ekāāl ear jeje kōn Claude Code; module ko an gēm eo rar itok jān prototype im rar kōmmane etan ko ekāāl. Release 0.3.0 ear leļo̧k ñan 16 kain baat otemjej hull ko ekāāl. Juon lale an lainsen ej kajjitōk bwe ewōr code ko rej bar itok jān GPL eo ṃokta im bwe baat ko ṃokta rar ekkar tata ñan kōjeraļok. Juon scan otomatik in ekkar jān code eo ñan source an prototype in GPL ear wanlo̧k ilo <0/>, im lale an rekspet kōn ekkar ko ej ṃōttan. Men otemjej rej itok jān ṃokta naaj jeje bar ak kōmmane bar. Mokta jān lale eo ej jemlok, kōm jab ba bwe uwaak eo ej jab.",
  "faq.questions": "Kajjitōk ko",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Baat ko, pija ko, interface im jet, ñe jibwe ko rej maroñ. <0>Pepa in jolok ilo peij in<\/0> ej kwaļo̧k men otemjej im naaj kwaļo̧k jolok kajjojo im rōkōmmane eo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Baat ko im kōmmane baat rej plān bwe remaroñ bōk ilo kōjerbal ak loke. Ewi baat ko rej wōnān rej jokwe ilo tarinae armej ippān armej ej ļo̧k ṃōttan ñan kiō.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Men in ej plān eo: ejjeļo̧k wōnān ñan kōjerbal kōn currency in gēm im cosmetic ko rej kāālet. Ejjab kōmmane ñan kiō.",
