  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude im Claude Code rej trademark an Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine im Epic Games rej trademark an Epic Games, Inc. Blender ej trademark an Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena im Elite Dangerous rej trademark an ro rej pāleļe. Etan otemjej rej an ro rej pāleļe im rej kōjerbal ñan kwaļo̧k men ko rej ba kake wōt. Orion-81 ejjab ṃōttan ippāer, ejjab jipañ ak kōnnaan jān ro.",
