  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Ejjeļo̧k tracker. Ejjeļo̧k cookie. Peij in ej peij in arokite. Men otemjej rej itok jān archive an project eo; ejjeļo̧k men ijin ej leļo̧k ak kōnnaan.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ejjab wōr",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Juon men ej ļo̧k ṃōttan: <0>lale an lainsen<\/0> kōn code in gēm eo ear itok jān prototype in GPL. Juon scan otomatik in ekkar jān code eo ñan source an prototype ear wanlo̧k ilo <1/>, im lale an rekspet kōn ekkar ko ej ṃōttan.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ej juon project ekōmmane aolepān kōn AI.<\/0> Code an Orion-81 make jān Claude Code, rōkōjeraļok ej ṃōttan; baat ko, mep ko, texture ko im ainikien rar kōmmane kōn kein ko Claude Code ear jeje. Library ko in open-source rej kōjerbal rej pād ilo <1>'Jab AI ear kōmmane'<\/1>.",
